   "text": "routed experts (47×256) **302.80B** (97.4%) · attention + router + L0 FFN **4.73B** (1.5%) · embed **625.0M** (0.2%) · lm head **625.0M** (0.2%) · MTP ×3 **987.8M** (0.3%) · ViT + merger **728.6M** (0.2%) · audio encoder **261.1M** (0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bct",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1606,
