  {
   "id": "cap-bcl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1510,
   "width": 2900,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts (47×256) **9.46B** (63.8%) · attention + router + L0 FFN **4.73B** (31.9%) · lm head **625.0M** (4.2%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · MTP ×3 **0** (only when drafting) · ViT + merger **0** (runs per image / frame) · audio encoder **0** (runs per audio clip)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1420,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# MiMo-V2.6-Flash — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.06 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where the parameters and the compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length. Zoom in: *Layer* tab = one decoder layer.    \nSource: HF `XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL` config.json, modeling_mimo_v2.py, dflash/ and safetensors headers."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 160,
   "y": -1420,
   "width": 1440,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **SWA** (39): sliding window 128 tokens, 64 Q / 8 KV heads, learned per-head sink logit, RoPE θ 1e+04 · **GA** (9): global causal attention, 64 Q / 4 KV heads, RoPE θ 1e+07 (1M context) · **L0** is GA with a dense FFN.    \nEvery other layer: MoE, 256 routed experts, top-8, sigmoid router, no shared expert. MoE layer ≈ **6.54B**, 98% of all layer weights are routed experts. Pattern: L0 GA · (4 SWA, GA) · then (5 SWA, GA) ×7."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -1140,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
