   "y": 1766,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**3 MTP modules** (`model.mtp.layers.0–2`, 987.8M) ship in the main checkpoint; the HF modeling code skips them (`_keys_to_ignore_on_load_unexpected`) — serving engines use them as the EAGLE-style draft head (the README's SGLang recipe: `--enable-multi-layer-eagle`, 3 steps)."
